triggers the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in-app SVG export, rasterizes to PNG, and cleans up the window unless [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]--keep/--window.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Remote capture via --host[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]screenshot-remote[dim] · [dim][/dim]after screenshot-cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]screenshot-remote: resolve enrolled machine aliases or raw SSH [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]destinations, run the SVG capture leg remotely over SSH with a contract [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]probe and cleanup modeled on sudo/ssh.py, rasterize locally, and report [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the remote sase version.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Flat-note inline embedding in memory reads[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]memory-inline-embeds[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory-inline-embeds: make sase memory read/show render ![\\[target]] [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]links of flat notes inline with depth caps, cycle guards, and no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duplicate reference/children listings, updating docs and the test [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]locking old behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Author the TUI memory notes[/bold #D7AFFF]                                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]tui-memory-notes[dim] · [dim][/dim]after screenshot-remote, memory-inline-embeds[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui-memory-notes: create tui.md and tui_screenshot.md, reparent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tui_perf.md under tui.md, link tui_screenshot from lint_and_test.md, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]regenerate agent instructions via sase memory init.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-123","llm_provider