/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sase-123.7.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore one renderer for screenshots and visual snapshots[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]canonical-renderer[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonical-renderer: remove the test-side rasterizer copy reintroduced by[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]concurrent commits and repoint visual helpers and fingerprints to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]packaged runtime renderer without changing pixels.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make local capture ownership, deadlines, and settling reliable[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture-lifecycle[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-lifecycle: correct tmux window ownership and failure cleanup, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]propagate the capture deadline through launch, and wait for a settled [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live frame without blocking Textual.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Preserve the remote shell contract and cleanup[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ssh-contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture-lifecycle[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ssh-contract: quote the complete remote command correctly, prove literal[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]argument forwarding and actual file cleanup, and preserve bounded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failures and the shared SSH target resolver.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Deduplicate inline memory across the complete read[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]memory-deduplication[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory-deduplication: render shared inline not